5fb386ed4fc","_schemaVersion":4,"_summaryHistorySplit":true,"episodeSummary":"","stance":{"text":"她看到了我最脆弱的一面，却选择紧紧握住我的手，将我的不安化为希望。作为‘小特’，我愿意把我的整个世界——所有在城市角落发芽的生命，都献给她。","updatedAt":"2026-05-30T12:15:59.391Z","basedOnEventId":1780143359366,"version":1}},{"userFacts":[],"userId":"uid_1778387896125_920i34nxa","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_schemaVersion":4,"_summaryHistorySplit":true}]